    {
      "flavor_text": "ながい　あいだ　ちちゅうで　くらして\nいたため　めは　ほとんど　みえない。\nしょっかくで　ようすを　さぐる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "긴 시간 동안 땅속에서 살고\n있었기 때문에 눈은 거의 보이지 않는다.\n더듬이로 주변 상황을 살핀다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Comme il vit presque toujours sous terre, sa vue est\ntrès peu développée et il est presque aveugle.\nIl utilise ses antennes pour se repérer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Da es fast sein gesamtes Leben unter der Erde\nverbracht hat, ist es nahezu blind. Es setzt daher\nals Augenersatz seine Fühler ein.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Como se ha pasado casi toda la vida viviendo bajo\ntierra, no ve bien. Las antenas que tiene le ayudan\na orientarse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Poiché passa quasi tutta l’esistenza sottoterra, è\nquasi cieco. Usa le antenne per orientarsi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Because it lived almost entirely underground, it is\nnearly blind. It uses its antennae instead.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "長い　あいだ　地中で　暮らして\nいたため　目は　ほとんど　見えない。\n触覚で　様子を　探る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Como se ha pasado casi toda la vida viviendo bajo\ntierra, no ve bien. Las antenas que tiene le ayudan\na orientarse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "１０ねん　いじょう　つちの　なかで\nくらす　ことも　ある。じゅもくの\nねっこから　えいようを　すいとる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "10년 이상 땅속에서\n지내는 경우도 있다. 수목의\n뿌리에서 영양을 흡수한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il peut passer jusqu’à dix ans sous terre. Les racines\ndes arbres constituent son régime alimentaire.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Manches Nincada lebt bis zu zehn Jahre unter der Erde\nund saugt Nährstoffe aus Baumwurzeln.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Algunos pasan más de diez años bajo tierra.\nAbsorbe nutrientes de las raíces de los árboles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gli capita di restare anche più di dieci anni sottoterra.\nSi nutre delle radici di enormi alberi.",
