        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "alpha-sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/26/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nincada lives underground. It uses its sharp claws to carve the\nroots of trees and absorb moisture and nutrients.\nThis Pokémon can’t withstand bright sunlight so avoids it.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "alpha-sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/26/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "鋭い　ツメで　樹木の　根っこを　削り\n水分や　栄養を　吸収する。\n太陽の　光は　まぶしいので　苦手。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "alpha-sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/26/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nincada vive bajo tierra y usa las garras afiladas que tiene\npara escarbar y buscar raíces de árboles y absorber humedad\ny nutrientes. Este Pokémon huye de la luz del sol porque le\nhace daño.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "alpha-sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/26/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ながい　あいだ　ちちゅうで　くらして\nいたため　めは　ほとんど　みえない。\nしょっかくで　ようすを　さぐる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "긴 시간 동안 땅속에서 살았기 때문에\n눈이 거의 보이지 않는다.\n더듬이로 주변 상황을 살핀다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "因為長時間生活在地底下，\n所以眼睛幾乎什麼都看不到。\n會靠觸角來探察周圍的狀況。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Parce qu’il a longtemps vécu sous terre,\nil est presque aveugle et utilise ses antennes\npour se repérer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Da es fast sein gesamtes Leben unter der Erde\nverbracht hat, ist es nahezu blind. Es setzt daher\nals Augenersatz seine Fühler ein.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vivir bajo tierra durante tanto tiempo lo ha\ndejado prácticamente ciego. Las antenas que\ntiene le ayudan a orientarse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
